# Copy to .Renviron and edit for your site. .Renviron is gitignored: which Python
# interpreter to use is machine configuration, not project code.
#
# You usually do NOT need this file. _targets_common.R auto-detects a known interpreter
# (Vulcan's ~/venvs/phenovision, then HiPerGator's reticulate-gpu2) when RETICULATE_PYTHON
# is unset. Set it explicitly only to override that.
#
# Vulcan (Alliance):
# RETICULATE_PYTHON=~/venvs/phenovision/bin/python
#
# UF HiPerGator:
# RETICULATE_PYTHON=/blue/guralnick/r.dinnage/.conda/envs/reticulate-gpu2/bin/python
#
# Point the pipelines at a data store that is not reachable as ./data (see the data_root
# note in _targets_common.R). Normally unnecessary -- data/ is a symlink to the store.
# PHENOVISION_DATA_ROOT=/project/aip-dinnage/phenovision/data/phenobase_inat_data
